UPDATE `quest_template` SET `OfferRewardText`='Your service to the creatures of Shadowglen is worthy of reward, $N.$B$BYou confirmed my fears, however. The grellkin are still tainted by fel moss, despite Teldrassil''s blessing. Something sinister remains within the tree. I can only hope that the Gnarlpine tribe of furbolgs are free of the corruption, or we are still in grave danger.$B$BI will look into this further and contact those who might be of aid. Thank you, $C.' WHERE `Id`=28714 AND (`OfferRewardText` IS NULL OR `OfferRewardText`='');
